Hi Paul,

You should just export the method, i.e.:

 #' @S3method summary mcreg

and don't document use any other roxygen tags, unless you want to
fully document the method (which is not usually necessary)

Exporting the method means that summary(mymcregobject) will work, but
summary.mcreg(mymcregobject) will not (and that's what you want)

Hadley

